  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.1.0. OutboxStoreContractTests gains the scheduling cases, which run for a store that implements ISchedulingOutboxStore and are skipped for one that does not.\n            NotificationTransportContractTests (experimental, CQREXP001) checks a notification transport: what is sent arrives with its id, name, payload, key and trace context, in order, and an unreachable destination is Unavailable, never Rejected.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.1.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes; upgrading from 5.0 needs no code or schema change.",
